# n8n Agent Studio

Read `skills/n8n-agent-studio/SKILL.md` in full first, then `references/access-ladder.md` before choosing a route.

Quick reference (`N="bash skills/n8n-agent-studio/scripts/nx.sh"`):
- `$N doctor`, then `$N probe <url>` and `$N ladder --url <url> [--needs-login --goal write]`.
- `$N start --allow <domain>` (browser worker on 127.0.0.1:7788) and `$N login <url> --session <name>` (the user signs in themselves).
- `$N recipe new <template> -o r.json` → fill selectors → `$N recipe run r.json --headed` → save.
- `$N new recipe|agent|mcp -o flow/` → `$N build flow/workflow.ts -o flow/flow.json` → `$N test flow/flow.json flow/cases.json`.
- `$N selftest` must stay green before any change ships.
- NEVER create accounts, type passwords, solve captchas or bypass bot protection. Secrets only as {{secret:NAME}} via `$N secret NAME`. Ask before sending, paying, or writing production data.
